// The archives of cache index 2, the config table. Each one holds the
// records of a single config type, and `pack/<type>.pack` names those
// records — this file names the archives they live in.
//
// The id is what the client addresses the group by, which is why they are
// not consecutive: the gaps are groups this revision has no decoder for.

1=underlay
3=idk
4=overlay
5=inv
6=loc
8=enum
9=npc
10=obj
11=param
12=seq
13=spotanim
14=varbit
16=varp
19=varc
32=hitsplat
33=healthbar
34=struct
35=mapelement
38=dbrow
39=dbtable
